---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
title: "Think by Numbers"
description: "Data, evidence, and the scientific method, pointed at the question of how to make life on Earth as good as it can be. The projects, the articles, and the world that could be."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{%- set mp = manualParams %}
<style>
  .home {
    --home-paper: var(--color-bg);
    --home-paper-2: var(--color-paper);
    --home-ink: var(--color-text);
    --home-soft: var(--color-text-light);
    --home-rule: #d9d9d9;
    --home-rule-strong: var(--color-text);
    --home-hover: #24488a;
    --home-bp: #1f4079;
    --home-bp-line: #f6f4ee;
    --home-bp-soft: rgba(246, 244, 238, 0.72);
    --home-bp-rule: rgba(246, 244, 238, 0.32);
    --home-bp-grid: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.075);
    --home-mono: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
    color: var(--home-ink);
    background: var(--home-paper);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .home {
    --home-rule: #333333;
    --home-hover: #9cb8ee;
  }
  .home h1, .home h2, .home h3 { line-height: 1.15; margin: 0; text-wrap: balance; }
  .home p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .home a { color: var(--home-ink); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 0.16em; }
  .home a:hover { color: var(--home-hover); }
  .home :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--home-hover); outline-offset: 3px; }

  .home-wrap { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); }

  /* Shared furniture */
  .home-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--home-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--home-soft);
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .home-eyebrow::after { content: ""; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--home-rule); }
  .home-sec { padding: 3.75rem 0 1.5rem; }
  .home-sec-head { margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
  .home-sec-head h2 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.3rem); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }
  .home-intro { font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 62ch; margin: 0; }
  .home-foot { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--home-soft); margin: 1.25rem 0 0; }

  .home-cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem 1.1rem; align-items: center; margin: 1.6rem 0 0; }
  .home a.home-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.62rem 1.15rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
